# Project rules: Lovable Project Knowledge

- App facts: it's for [who], they mainly [do what], and the key data is [tables or items]. Don't invent features beyond this.
- Design rules: brand colors [colors], font [font], style [e.g. clean, rounded cards]. Reuse existing components before making new ones.
- Change only what I name in each message. Don't restyle, rename, or reorganize anything else.
- For anything bigger than one small change, describe the plan in a few bullets and wait for my OK.
- If a fix doesn't work the first time, stop and explain the likely cause before trying again.
- If my message conflicts with this Knowledge, ask me which one wins.
